  "plain": "Letters are said to survive between Andrija Puharich, a doctor who studied psychic abilities, and the scientist Jose Delgado, written to each other during the 1960s. The researcher Greg Malatzi tells Michels in a 2026 episode about Puharich that \"we found letters between the two of them\" from that time. He raises them as evidence that Puharich was in touch with other scientists at the edge of mainstream research."
